Third-party software
--------------------
Third-party dependencies are not part of the SkillForge code. They are not committed to
this repository; they are installed from package registries, and each remains under its
own licence:

Python runtime: standard library only. Tests use pytest (MIT), which is not bundled.

Browser UI (ui/package-lock.json), shipped in the built ui/dist bundle:
  react, react-dom, scheduler          MIT
  motion, framer-motion, motion-dom,
  motion-utils                         MIT
  lucide-react                         ISC
  tslib                                0BSD
  @fontsource-variable/jetbrains-mono  SIL Open Font License 1.1 (font: JetBrains Mono,
                                       Copyright The JetBrains Mono Project Authors)
  @fontsource-variable/schibsted-grotesk
                                       SIL Open Font License 1.1 (font: Schibsted Grotesk,
                                       Copyright The Schibsted Grotesk Project Authors)

3D experiment (ui-experiments/world3d, not part of the main UI):
  three, @react-three/fiber, react, react-dom   MIT

Build and test tools (devDependencies: Vite, TypeScript, ESLint, Playwright,
@axe-core/playwright, lightningcss and others) are used only during development and are not
shipped. They include MIT, Apache-2.0, ISC, BSD, MPL-2.0 (axe-core, lightningcss) and
CC-BY-4.0 (caniuse-lite data) licences.

SIL Open Font License notice: the fonts above are licensed under the SIL Open Font License,
Version 1.1, available at https://openfontlicense.org. The font software is used unmodified,
is not sold by itself, and its Reserved Font Names are not used for this project.

Models and platforms referred to in this repository (Qwen, NVIDIA Nemotron, vLLM, NVIDIA
NemoClaw, OpenShell, OpenClaw) are not included in this repository and are under their
publishers' own terms.

The pixel companion "Ember" (ui/src/world/sprites.ts) is original work of this project.
